  <h2 class="mt-3 font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl">Stay curious about fungi</h2>
  <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-sage-100">Newsletter signup is coming soon. Follow new species profiles, growing lessons, and seasonal guides.</p>
  <form class="mx-auto mt-7 flex max-w-lg flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row" aria-label="Newsletter placeholder" onsubmit="return false">
